{"ordinal":14878,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452291633154","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Death_01153c1","source":"Fugitive: Урод…","target":"Fugitive: Nenorocitule…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-376.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14879,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452291633153","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Death_020a6d6","source":"Fugitive: Блять, сбежал от одних уродов, чтобы меня застрелил другой…","target":"Fugitive: Futu-i, am scăpat de unii nenorociți ca să mă împuște altul…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-376.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14880,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452291633152","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Ears_DontShoot_003f4e5","source":"Fugitive: Говорят, если долго жить в тишине, начинаешь слышать то, чего не должно быть. В карантине мы проверили это на себе.","target":"Fugitive: Se spune că, dacă trăiești prea mult în liniște, începi să auzi lucruri care n-ar trebui să existe. În carantină am verificat asta pe pielea noastră.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-376.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14881,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452287438859","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Photo_DontShoot_0078d89","source":"Fugitive: Если они вдруг придут к тебе и будут показывать мою фотку, не сдавай меня. Пожалуйста. Я пожить ещё хочу!","target":"Fugitive: Dacă vin cumva la tine și îți arată fotografia mea, nu mă turna. Te rog. Vreau să mai trăiesc!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-376.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14882,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452287438858","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Photo_DontShoot_04e10d7","source":"Fugitive: КЧС тоже делают фотографии. Правда, сразу, как к ним приходишь. Для протокола и всякой такой херни.","target":"Fugitive: Și Comitetul face fotografii. Numai că le face imediat ce ajungi la ei. Pentru dosar și alte căcaturi de genul ăsta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-376.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14883,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452287438857","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Armpit_DontShoot_09dba2d","source":"Fugitive: В карантинной зоне один парень всё чесался, пока… ну, пока не перестал. Теперь и я чешусь. Может, это просто нервы?","target":"Fugitive: În zona de carantină, un tip se tot scărpina până când… ei, până n-a mai făcut-o. Acum mă scarpin și eu. Poate e doar de la nervi?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-376.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14884,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452287438856","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Armpit_DontShoot_0a5465a","source":"Fugitive: В карантинной зоне один парень всё чесался, пока… ну, пока не перестал. Теперь и я чешусь. Вроде грибок какой-то. А может, это просто нервы?","target":"Fugitive: În zona de carantină, un tip se tot scărpina până când… ei, până n-a mai făcut-o. Acum mă scarpin și eu. Pare să fie o micoză. Sau poate e doar de la nervi?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-376.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14885,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452287438855","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Eyes_DontShoot_0da1f1f","source":"Fugitive: КЧС-ники не смотрят в глаза. Ни друг другу, ни тем, кого забирают. Как думаешь, почему?","target":"Fugitive: Cei de la Comitet nu se uită în ochii nimănui. Nici între ei, nici la oamenii pe care îi iau. De ce crezi?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-376.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14886,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452287438854","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Hands_DontShoot_0bae9e3","source":"Fugitive: Ты, это, поаккуратнее с таким. Я-то, может, и прощу, но другие могут быть понервозней. Обидятся, и тебе не проснуться уже…","target":"Fugitive: Ai grijă cu asta. Eu poate te iert, dar alții ar putea fi mai nervoși. Se supără și s-ar putea să nu te mai trezești…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-376.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14887,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452287438853","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Hands_DontShoot_0150f37","source":"Fugitive: Блять, парень, как же ты мне напоминаешь этих в жёлтом. Как что-то не то, так сразу за оружие хватаются и шмаляют в кого ни попадя.","target":"Fugitive: Futu-i, omule, semeni tare mult cu cei în galben. Cum li se pare ceva suspect, pun mâna pe arme și trag în cine apucă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-376.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14888,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452287438852","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Teeth_DontShoot_02331be","source":"Fugitive: В карантинной зоне не было зеркал. Нам не нужно было видеть, как мы превращаемся в скот.","target":"Fugitive: În zona de carantină nu erau oglinzi. Nu trebuia să vedem cum ne transformăm în vite.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-376.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14889,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452287438851","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Ears_Gun_041e53d","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14890,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452287438850","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Ears_Gun_025d55e","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14891,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452287438849","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Ears_Gun_0e65bb2","source":"Fugitive: Да ты чё? Если хочешь, я помою уши! Не надо в меня стволом тыкать! Можно ж просто попросить!","target":"Fugitive: Ce-ai, omule? Dacă vrei, îmi spăl urechile! Nu-mi mai îndrepta arma spre mine! Poți să-mi ceri, pur și simplu!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-376.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14892,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452287438848","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Photo_Gun_0d67eb6","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14893,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452283244555","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Photo_Gun_04dd308","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14894,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452283244554","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Photo_Gun_0edbeea","source":"Fugitive: Ты что? Хочешь, чтобы эта фотография стала последним, что от меня останется?","target":"Fugitive: Ce faci? Vrei ca fotografia asta să fie ultimul lucru care rămâne din mine?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-376.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14895,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452283244553","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Armpit_Gun_0551904","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14896,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452283244552","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Armpit_Gun_088b137","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14897,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452283244551","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Armpit_Gun_021a8c8","source":"Fugitive: Это что, какой-то новый уровень отбора? Я ж всё сделал, как ты попросил. Какого хера тебе ещё от меня надо, а???","target":"Fugitive: Ăsta e vreun nivel nou de selecție? Am făcut tot ce mi-ai cerut. Ce dracu’ mai vrei de la mine, a???","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-376.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14898,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452283244550","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Eyes_Gun_060a75d","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14899,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452283244549","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Eyes_Gun_09d8b2b","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14900,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452283244548","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Eyes_Gun_03a7532","source":"Fugitive: Ты хотя бы опыты над моими глазами не проводишь, спасибо огромное! В ноги только не поклонюсь.","target":"Fugitive: Măcar nu faci experimente pe ochii mei, mulțumesc frumos! Dar nu mă plec la picioarele tale.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-376.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14901,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452283244547","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Eyes_Gun_047199f","source":"Fugitive: Я уже насмотрелся на маньяков, параноиков и просто ублюдков. Тут ничем не лучше с таким давлением, которое ты оказываешь!","target":"Fugitive: Am văzut destui maniaci, paranoici și nenorociți de rând. Nici aici nu e mai bine, cu presiunea pe care o pui pe mine!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-376.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14902,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452283244546","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Hands_Gun_0676428","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14903,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452283244545","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Hands_Gun_0d6c725","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14904,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452283244544","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Hands_Gun_0ffd4d1","source":"Fugitive: Если ты хочешь убить меня за грязные руки, тогда тебе бы весь этот город под ноль вырезать.","target":"Fugitive: Dacă vrei să mă omori pentru că am mâinile murdare, ar trebui să măcelărești tot orașul.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-376.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14905,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452279050251","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Hands_Gun_02b228c","source":"Fugitive: Если ты хочешь убить меня за какие-то не такие руки, тогда тебе бы весь этот город под ноль вырезать.","target":"Fugitive: Dacă vrei să mă omori pentru că mâinile mele nu-ți par în regulă, ar trebui să măcelărești tot orașul.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-376.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14906,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452279050250","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Teeth_Gun_0b44650","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14907,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452279050249","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Teeth_Gun_0c1ccb6","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14908,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452279050248","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Teeth_Gun_04f30fd","source":"Fugitive: Блять, не делай глупостей. Я уже разок пулю схватил, второй раз как-то не хочется.","target":"Fugitive: Futu-i, nu face vreo prostie. Am încasat deja un glonț; n-aș vrea să se întâmple iar.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-376.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14909,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452279050247","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Ears_0a329c6","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14910,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452279050246","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Ears_053e47a","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14911,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452279050245","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Ears_0b51bb4","source":"Fugitive: Грязные, ага. Не поверишь, в КЧС нет душевых с тёплой водой и ватными палочками. Чёртов сервис, да?","target":"Fugitive: Murdare, da. N-o să-ți vină să crezi, la Comitet nu au dușuri cu apă caldă și bețișoare de urechi. Ce servicii de căcat, nu?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-377.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14912,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452279050244","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Ears_0ffc845","source":"Fugitive: ...","target":"Fugitive: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-377.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14913,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452279050243","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Ears_0f79806","source":"Fugitive: Серьёзно? Ты думаешь, Гостя можно вычислить по ушам? Ну, смотри.","target":"Fugitive: Vorbești serios? Crezi că poți recunoaște un Musafir după urechi? Hai, uită-te.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-377.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14914,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452279050242","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Ears_0dc82e2","source":"Fugitive: Грязные, ага. Как у любого человека, если он живёт и что-то делает, а моется не каждый день.","target":"Fugitive: Murdare, da. Ca la oricine trăiește și face ceva, dar nu se spală în fiecare zi.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-377.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14915,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452279050241","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Ears_08fce5e","source":"Fugitive: ...","target":"Fugitive: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-377.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14916,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452279050240","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Ears_0036756","source":"Fugitive: Серьёзно? Ты думаешь, это не признак для того, чтобы посеять панику ещё больше?","target":"Fugitive: Serios? Nu crezi că ăsta e încă un semn numai bun ca să stârnească și mai multă panică?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-377.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14917,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452274855948","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Photo_08e5613","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14918,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452274855947","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Photo_02fd789","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14919,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452274855946","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Photo_056ae85","source":"Fugitive: Ну что, как я там получился?.. Блин, погоди, я надеюсь, что ты это не для КЧС-ников готовишь, чтобы меня сдать!","target":"Fugitive: Ei, cum am ieșit?.. Fir-ar, stai, sper că nu pregătești fotografia asta pentru cei de la Comitet, ca să mă dai pe mâna lor!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-377.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14920,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452274855945","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Photo_01d97fc","source":"Fugitive: Я вообще не очень люблю фотографироваться.","target":"Fugitive: Oricum nu-mi prea place să fiu fotografiat.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-377.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14921,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452274855944","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Photo_0f9c8fc","source":"Fugitive: ...","target":"Fugitive: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-377.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14922,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452274855943","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Photo_0848972","source":"Fugitive: Ха, а я думал, никто уже не занимается таким!","target":"Fugitive: Ha, credeam că nimeni nu mai face așa ceva!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-377.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14923,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452274855942","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Armpit_04766d7","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14924,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452274855941","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Armpit_049dc0e","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14925,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452274855940","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Fugitive_Armpit_0d4ef7d","source":"Fugitive: Приятель, я неделю в бегах. Не до бритья, сам понимаешь.","target":"Fugitive: Prietene, fug de o săptămână. N-am avut timp să mă rad, înțelegi și tu.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-377.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
